  "name": "Guardian Battle Rush charges and damages a stun-immune target (#9003)",
  "contract": [
    "Battle Rush 501546 has three effects: SPELL_EFFECT_CHARGE and SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE carry no per-effect",
    "Mechanic, only its SPELL_AURA_MOD_STUN effect does (EffectMechanic[2]=12). Its whole-spell DBC Mechanic field",
    "was redundantly also set to Stun, so Unit::IsImmunedToSpell's whole-spell mechanic check rejected the entire",
    "cast against any stun-immune target (e.g. a dungeon boss such as Taragaman the Hungerer, 11520, already used",
    "by boss-stun-immunity-7287 as stun-immune), blocking the charge and damage along with the stun. Clearing the",
    "redundant whole-spell Mechanic (AscensionGuardianAbilities.cpp, guardian_battle_rush_metadata) leaves the",
    "per-effect stun Mechanic intact: the charge must land and deal damage, while the stun itself must still be",
    "blocked by the target's own immunity."
  ],
